  "item_short_desc": "<p>Gear up for action and adventure with Rothco&rsquo;s 2-Tone Camo BDU Shorts. These cargo shorts feature a unique 2-tone camouflage design, with each leg in a different camo pattern for a distinct and stylish look. The tactical shorts include 2 front slash pockets, 2 rear button-down pockets, and 2 large side cargo pockets, offering ample space to carry your essentials securely.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "3795",
  "description": "<p>Gear up for action and adventure with Rothco&rsquo;s 2-Tone Camo BDU Shorts. These cargo shorts feature a unique 2-tone camouflage design, with each leg in a different camo pattern for a distinct and stylish look. The tactical shorts include 2 front slash pockets, 2 rear button-down pockets, and 2 large side cargo pockets, offering ample space to carry your essentials securely. Made from a soft and breathable poly-cotton blend, these tactical cargo shorts ensure comfort and durability, making them perfect for extended wear during outdoor activities. Equipped with adjustable waist tabs, these camo shorts provide a customizable fit, ensuring comfort and ease of movement for various body types. The button fly closure adds a classic touch to the shorts, combining traditional design with modern functionality for a versatile and stylish addition to your wardrobe.</p>",
